    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n28 Clonlea is a well presented two-bedroomed duplex which is situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in Mount Oval. This property boasts a private west facing balcony, a large green area to the front and a designated parking space, with ample visitor spaces nearby.\n\nThe property arrives to the market in good decorative condition and extends to approximately 78sq.m. Upon entering the home you are greeted by a bright entrance hall, spacious living room to the front, a storage room and a kitchen/dining area to the rear with a west facing balcony. On the first floor there are two double bedrooms and a main bathroom. \n\nClonlea is situated in a convenient location in Mount Oval Village being within a short distance from a host of amenities including a local shop, pub, pharmacy and much more. It is a short drive to areas such as Passage, Rochestown and Douglas. The area is well-serviced by public transport giving people easy access to the city centre. \n\nViewings come highly recommended to fully appreciate this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.24m x 1.68m\nThe entrance hall gives direct access to the living room and stairs to the first floor. It benefits from tiled flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.76m x 5.16m\nThis is spacious living room features a bay window overlooking the green area to the front. It benefits from a gas fireplace with a cast iron surround and laminate wood flooring.\n\nStorage - 1.24m x 1.92m\nThis room is located off the Living Room. It is used for storage.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.92m x 3.57m\nThis is an open plan kitchen/dining area. It is accessed via French doors from the living room. The kitchen is well-fitted with floor and eye-level units, a selection of premium kitchen appliances, a tiled splash back and a west facing window overlooking the rear. The dining area is an open reception space with French doors leading out to the balcony.\n\nLanding - \nCarpeted stairs leading to a landing providing access to all rooms on the first floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.56m x 3.10m\nThis is a double bedroom located to the front of the property. It consists of one window and a Velux window providing ample natural light to the room. It has ample built in wardrobes and hard wood flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.87m x 3.38m\nThis is a second double bedroom located to the rear of the property. It features one window, built-in wardrobes and hard wood flooring.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.97m x 2.37m\nThe bathroom consists of a three-piece bath suite with an electric shower. It benefits from being fully tiled and a Velux window.\n\n"
      },
